0.02516193,0.00991851,-0.00832258,0.1765984,-0.0043108,-0.02275355,0.04367569,-0.00935921,0.06055243,0.02592661,0.03852027,-0.02747895,-0.00826271,0.02826731,-0.03813972,0.01646928,0.06738241,-0.00832056,0.00852508,0.02457305,-0.00560494,-0.06275169,0.01452122,0.01724206,0.02521429,0.01629687,-0.11467875,-0.03406537,-0.03431209,-0.02653533,-0.00734365,-0.06410491,0.00135889,-0.00853289,0.02449238,0.04145209,0.07178566,-0.00144647,-0.00535631,-0.05157151,-0.00402369,0.02738496,-0.0374038,0.08872491,0.05599552,0.02806434],"last_embed":{"hash":"1v704ke","tokens":454}}},"last_read":{"hash":"1v704ke","at":1774580789052},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1773447493320,"size":6342,"at":1774579779528,"hash":"1v704ke"},"blocks":{"#Guia de Instalador e Deployment - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📦 Criando o Instalador Executável\\n\\n### Passo 1: Preparar Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar dependências de build\\nnpm install -g electron-builder\\nnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 2: Build da Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build para produção\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# Gerar executável\\nnpm run electron:build\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 3: Criar Instalador\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configuração no package.json\\n\\\"build\\\": {\\n  \\\"appId\\\": \\\"com.aquilapro.desktop\\\",\\n  \\\"productName\\\": \\\"Áquila Pro\\\",\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    \\\"dist/**/*\\\",\\n    \\\"node_modules/**/*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"win\\\": {\\n    \\\"target\\\": [\\n      \\\"nsis\\\",\\n      \\\"portable\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"nsis\\\": {\\n    \\\"oneClick\\\": false,\\n    \\\"allowToChangeInstallationDirectory\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createDesktopShortcut\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createStartMenuShortcut\\\": true\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 4: Gerar Arquivo .exe\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build final\\nelectron-builder --win --publish never\\n\\n# Resultado: dist/Áquila Pro Setup 1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Deployment em Servidor\\n\\n### Opção 1: Servidor Local (Recomendado para Escolas)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Instalar Node.js no servidor\\nhttps://nodejs.org/en/download/\\n\\n# 2. Clonar repositório\\ngit clone https://github.com/seu-usuario/aquila-pro.git\\ncd aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 4. Configurar variáveis de ambiente\\ncp .env.example .env\\n# Editar .env com dados da escola\\n\\n# 5. Iniciar servidor\\nnpm start\\n\\n# 6. Acessar em http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 2: Cloud (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Exemplo com AWS EC2\\n\\n# 1. Criar instância EC2 (Ubuntu 20.04)\\n# 2. SSH para instância\\nssh -i chave.pem ubuntu@seu-ip\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt update\\nsudo apt install nodejs npm postgresql\\n\\n# 4. Clonar e configurar\\ngit clone seu-repositorio\\ncd aquila-pro\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 5. Configurar PM2 para manter serviço rodando\\nnpm install -g pm2\\npm2 start npm --name \\\"aquila-pro\\\" -- start\\npm2 startup\\npm2 save\\n\\n# 6. Configurar Nginx como proxy\\nsudo apt install nginx\\n# Configurar /etc/nginx/sites-available/default\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 3: Docker (Para Escalabilidade)\\n\\n```dockerfile\\n# Dockerfile\\nFROM node:18-alpine\\n\\nWORKDIR /app\\n\\nCOPY package*.json ./\\nRUN npm install\\n\\nCOPY . .\\n\\nRUN npm run build\\n\\nEXPOSE 3000\\n\\nCMD [\\\"npm\\\", \\\"start\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build e executar\\ndocker build -t aquila-pro .\\ndocker run -p 3000:3000 -e DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n### Antes do Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Testar aplicação localmente\\n- [ ] Executar testes automatizados\\n- [ ] Validar segurança (OWASP Top 10)\\n- [ ] Configurar HTTPS/SSL\\n- [ ] Preparar banco de dados\\n- [ ] Fazer backup de dados\\n- [ ] Documentar processo\\n\\n### Durante o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Parar serviço anterior (se houver)\\n- [ ] Fazer backup do banco de dados\\n- [ ] Executar migrações\\n- [ ] Iniciar novo serviço\\n- [ ] Testar funcionalidades críticas\\n- [ ] Monitorar logs\\n- [ ] Validar performance\\n\\n### Após o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Notificar usuários\\n- [ ] Monitorar sistema por 24h\\n- [ ] Coletar feedback\\n- [ ] Documentar issues\\n- [ ] Preparar rollback se necessário\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança no Deployment\\n\\n### HTTPS/SSL\\n\\n```bash\\n# Usar Let's Encrypt (gratuito)\\nsudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx\\nsudo certbot certonly --nginx -d seu-dominio.com\\n\\n# Configurar Nginx\\nserver {\\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name seu-dominio.com;\\n    \\n    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/privkey.pem;\\n    \\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar UFW (Ubuntu)\\nsudo ufw enable\\nsudo ufw allow 22/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp\\nsudo ufw deny 3000/tcp  # Bloquear acesso direto\\n```\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# .env (nunca commitar)\\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost/aquila\\nJWT_SECRET=seu-secret-aleatorio-muito-longo\\nNODE_ENV=production\\nAPI_KEY=sua-chave-api\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Ver logs em tempo real\\npm2 logs aquila-pro\\n\\n# Salvar logs\\npm2 save\\npm2 logs aquila-pro > /var/log/aquila-pro.log\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar PM2 Plus (monitoramento)\\npm2 install pm2-auto-pull\\npm2 install pm2-logrotate\\n\\n# Dashboard\\npm2 monit\\n```\\n\\n### Alertas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar alertas de CPU/RAM\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull instances 4\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull max_memory_restart 1G\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualização e Rollback\\n\\n### Atualizar Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Fazer backup\\npm2 backup\\n\\n# 2. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Atualizar código\\ngit pull origin main\\nnpm install\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# 4. Executar migrações (se houver)\\nnpm run migrate\\n\\n# 5. Reiniciar serviço\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 6. Validar\\ncurl http://localhost:3000/health\\n```\\n\\n### Rollback (Se Algo Deu Errado)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 2. Voltar para versão anterior\\ngit revert HEAD\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 3. Restaurar banco de dados\\npsql -U user -d aquila < backup.sql\\n\\n# 4. Reiniciar\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📈 Performance\\n\\n### Otimizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Compressão Gzip\\nserver {\\n    gzip on;\\n    gzip_types text/plain text/css application/json application/javascript;\\n    gzip_min_length 1000;\\n}\\n\\n# 2. Cache\\nproxy_cache_path /var/cache/nginx levels=1:2 keys_zone=my_cache:10m;\\nproxy_cache my_cache;\\nproxy_cache_valid 200 10m;\\n\\n# 3. Load Balancing\\nupstream aquila_backend {\\n    server localhost:3000;\\n    server localhost:3001;\\n    server localhost:3002;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Benchmarks\\n\\n```bash\\n# Testar performance\\nab -n 1000 -c 100 http://seu-dominio.com/\\n\\n# Esperado:\\n# - Requests/sec: 500+\\n# - Latência média: <100ms\\n# - Taxa de sucesso: 99.9%+\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte Técnico\\n\\n**Contatos:**\\n- Email: deploy@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Slack: #deployment\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n**Horário de Suporte:**\\n- Seg-Sex: 08:00-18:00\\n- Sábado: 09:00-13:00\\n- Emergências: 24/7\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Última atualização:** 15 de janeiro de 2024\\n":[1,2]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"tags":["#deployment"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"1v704ke","at":1774580788909}},"smart_blocks:docs/INSTALLER_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md#Guia de Instalador e Deployment - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📦 Criando o Instalador Executável\\n\\n### Passo 1: Preparar Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar dependências de build\\nnpm install -g electron-builder\\nnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 2: Build da Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build para produção\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# Gerar executável\\nnpm run electron:build\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 3: Criar Instalador\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configuração no package.json\\n\\\"build\\\": {\\n  \\\"appId\\\": \\\"com.aquilapro.desktop\\\",\\n  \\\"productName\\\": \\\"Áquila Pro\\\",\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    \\\"dist/**/*\\\",\\n    \\\"node_modules/**/*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"win\\\": {\\n    \\\"target\\\": [\\n      \\\"nsis\\\",\\n      \\\"portable\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"nsis\\\": {\\n    \\\"oneClick\\\": false,\\n    \\\"allowToChangeInstallationDirectory\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createDesktopShortcut\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createStartMenuShortcut\\\": true\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 4: Gerar Arquivo .exe\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build final\\nelectron-builder --win --publish never\\n\\n# Resultado: dist/Áquila Pro Setup 1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Deployment em Servidor\\n\\n### Opção 1: Servidor Local (Recomendado para Escolas)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Instalar Node.js no servidor\\nhttps://nodejs.org/en/download/\\n\\n# 2. Clonar repositório\\ngit clone https://github.com/seu-usuario/aquila-pro.git\\ncd aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 4. Configurar variáveis de ambiente\\ncp .env.example .env\\n# Editar .env com dados da escola\\n\\n# 5. Iniciar servidor\\nnpm start\\n\\n# 6. Acessar em http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 2: Cloud (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Exemplo com AWS EC2\\n\\n# 1. Criar instância EC2 (Ubuntu 20.04)\\n# 2. SSH para instância\\nssh -i chave.pem ubuntu@seu-ip\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt update\\nsudo apt install nodejs npm postgresql\\n\\n# 4. Clonar e configurar\\ngit clone seu-repositorio\\ncd aquila-pro\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 5. Configurar PM2 para manter serviço rodando\\nnpm install -g pm2\\npm2 start npm --name \\\"aquila-pro\\\" -- start\\npm2 startup\\npm2 save\\n\\n# 6. Configurar Nginx como proxy\\nsudo apt install nginx\\n# Configurar /etc/nginx/sites-available/default\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 3: Docker (Para Escalabilidade)\\n\\n```dockerfile\\n# Dockerfile\\nFROM node:18-alpine\\n\\nWORKDIR /app\\n\\nCOPY package*.json ./\\nRUN npm install\\n\\nCOPY . .\\n\\nRUN npm run build\\n\\nEXPOSE 3000\\n\\nCMD [\\\"npm\\\", \\\"start\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build e executar\\ndocker build -t aquila-pro .\\ndocker run -p 3000:3000 -e DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n### Antes do Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Testar aplicação localmente\\n- [ ] Executar testes automatizados\\n- [ ] Validar segurança (OWASP Top 10)\\n- [ ] Configurar HTTPS/SSL\\n- [ ] Preparar banco de dados\\n- [ ] Fazer backup de dados\\n- [ ] Documentar processo\\n\\n### Durante o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Parar serviço anterior (se houver)\\n- [ ] Fazer backup do banco de dados\\n- [ ] Executar migrações\\n- [ ] Iniciar novo serviço\\n- [ ] Testar funcionalidades críticas\\n- [ ] Monitorar logs\\n- [ ] Validar performance\\n\\n### Após o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Notificar usuários\\n- [ ] Monitorar sistema por 24h\\n- [ ] Coletar feedback\\n- [ ] Documentar issues\\n- [ ] Preparar rollback se necessário\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança no Deployment\\n\\n### HTTPS/SSL\\n\\n```bash\\n# Usar Let's Encrypt (gratuito)\\nsudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx\\nsudo certbot certonly --nginx -d seu-dominio.com\\n\\n# Configurar Nginx\\nserver {\\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name seu-dominio.com;\\n    \\n    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/privkey.pem;\\n    \\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar UFW (Ubuntu)\\nsudo ufw enable\\nsudo ufw allow 22/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp\\nsudo ufw deny 3000/tcp  # Bloquear acesso direto\\n```\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# .env (nunca commitar)\\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost/aquila\\nJWT_SECRET=seu-secret-aleatorio-muito-longo\\nNODE_ENV=production\\nAPI_KEY=sua-chave-api\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Ver logs em tempo real\\npm2 logs aquila-pro\\n\\n# Salvar logs\\npm2 save\\npm2 logs aquila-pro > /var/log/aquila-pro.log\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar PM2 Plus (monitoramento)\\npm2 install pm2-auto-pull\\npm2 install pm2-logrotate\\n\\n# Dashboard\\npm2 monit\\n```\\n\\n### Alertas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar alertas de CPU/RAM\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull instances 4\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull max_memory_restart 1G\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualização e Rollback\\n\\n### Atualizar Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Fazer backup\\npm2 backup\\n\\n# 2. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Atualizar código\\ngit pull origin main\\nnpm install\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# 4. Executar migrações (se houver)\\nnpm run migrate\\n\\n# 5. Reiniciar serviço\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 6. Validar\\ncurl http://localhost:3000/health\\n```\\n\\n### Rollback (Se Algo Deu Errado)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 2. Voltar para versão anterior\\ngit revert HEAD\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 3. Restaurar banco de dados\\npsql -U user -d aquila < backup.sql\\n\\n# 4. Reiniciar\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📈 Performance\\n\\n### Otimizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Compressão Gzip\\nserver {\\n    gzip on;\\n    gzip_types text/plain text/css application/json application/javascript;\\n    gzip_min_length 1000;\\n}\\n\\n# 2. Cache\\nproxy_cache_path /var/cache/nginx levels=1:2 keys_zone=my_cache:10m;\\nproxy_cache my_cache;\\nproxy_cache_valid 200 10m;\\n\\n# 3. Load Balancing\\nupstream aquila_backend {\\n    server localhost:3000;\\n    server localhost:3001;\\n    server localhost:3002;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Benchmarks\\n\\n```bash\\n# Testar performance\\nab -n 1000 -c 100 http://seu-dominio.com/\\n\\n# Esperado:\\n# - Requests/sec: 500+\\n# - Latência média: <100ms\\n# - Taxa de sucesso: 99.9%+\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte Técnico\\n\\n**Contatos:**\\n- Email: deploy@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Slack: #deployment\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n**Horário de Suporte:**\\n- Seg-Sex: 08:00-18:00\\n- Sábado: 09:00-13:00\\n- Emergências: 24/7\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Última atualização:** 15 de janeiro de 2024\\n": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.06195571,0.03997389,0.05483847,-0.01585753,0.00878926,0.02811478,-0.10933705,-0.01800754,0.00364914,-0.01658903,0.02798279,-0.07813455,0.04724717,-0.01532235,0.06212477,0.0474052,-0.01365265,0.03090583,0.01744806,-0.03037758,0.01864607,-0.05561023,0.04167093,-0.01732376,0.01903863,0.07345595,0.00848262,-0.01167496,-0.03534386,-0.19840373,-0.009131,-0.00906514,-0.02994196,0.01574766,-0.00858898,0.00544108,-0.07219494,-0.01725493,-0.04931008,0.02261505,-0.005471,0.02076616,-0.02634332,-0.02462513,0.03299411,-0.0502449,0.00180995,-0.02566842,0.05058704,-0.03883975,0.01360318,0.02553506,0.0389001,-0.0227057,-0.0542781,0.01409096,0.08175479,0.06910232,0.03218358,0.05270231,-0.02533168,0.03219936,-0.21937297,0.09310383,0.06156379,-0.04832965,-0.07025753,-0.05228015,0.03445773,0.04461575,-0.01568801,-0.0081307,0.0537512,0.04751151,0.04311126,0.04452634,0.04706828,-0.01193557,0.05690781,-0.02108858,-0.01967467,0.0218979,-0.07103618,0.02460086,-0.00655922,-0.02058027,0.05079764,-0.01507781,0.02704658,0.03025998,-0.08107918,-0.01652198,0.03099637,0.05830829,0.01683306,-0.03855434,0.00811562,0.00028076,-0.1215733,0.11665975,0.02195902,-0.02095272,-0.01811564,-0.02178607,0.02354548,0.00389269,-0.00865872,-0.01338286,-0.02880261,-0.04098884,0.027529,-0.02265259,-0.00633708,-0.12458982,0.00537214,-0.01589291,-0.01095933,-0.03214458,0.03407286,-0.00575806,0.02688599,-0.02641416,0.09570771,0.04051756,0.03412391,-0.06074561,0.02599312,-0.00033695,-0.00710367,0.03916114,-0.00511528,0.03023224,0.00988645,0.03150299,-0.02800757,0.05475159,0.0240239,0.02142266,-0.03700027,0.00596365,-0.01300547,-0.00209586,0