9,-0.05204592,-0.26129061,-0.00172602,0.06088136,-0.03906957,-0.05408937,-0.0110746,-0.00416693,-0.02728304,-0.02691931,0.00551882,-0.01211979,0.01724084,-0.03157225,-0.01857428,0.03478299,-0.03618488,0.06826515,0.0210069,0.02630865,-0.02370346,0.00743161,-0.01056527,0.17582583,-0.00347721,-0.02202693,0.0495009,-0.01218558,0.06009968,0.02390096,0.04129966,-0.03450793,-0.00553684,0.04042378,-0.04336608,0.01224328,0.06378858,-0.02173724,0.00785774,0.02549441,-0.0142345,-0.06765978,0.01631033,0.00960124,0.00739538,0.01690125,-0.10570219,-0.04388092,-0.02821133,-0.02132666,-0.00772851,-0.05530339,0.00628156,-0.00684435,0.03152313,0.03927897,0.06868664,-0.00469158,-0.00155908,-0.04532612,-0.01546143,0.01961044,-0.02912151,0.08229771,0.04489059,0.02668445],"last_embed":{"hash":"1v704ke","tokens":450}}},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1v704ke","at":1774580789052},"key":"docs/INSTALLER_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md#Guia de Instalador e Deployment - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📦 Criando o Instalador Executável\\n\\n### Passo 1: Preparar Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar dependências de build\\nnpm install -g electron-builder\\nnpm install\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 2: Build da Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build para produção\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# Gerar executável\\nnpm run electron:build\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 3: Criar Instalador\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configuração no package.json\\n\\\"build\\\": {\\n  \\\"appId\\\": \\\"com.aquilapro.desktop\\\",\\n  \\\"productName\\\": \\\"Áquila Pro\\\",\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    \\\"dist/**/*\\\",\\n    \\\"node_modules/**/*\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"win\\\": {\\n    \\\"target\\\": [\\n      \\\"nsis\\\",\\n      \\\"portable\\\"\\n    ]\\n  },\\n  \\\"nsis\\\": {\\n    \\\"oneClick\\\": false,\\n    \\\"allowToChangeInstallationDirectory\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createDesktopShortcut\\\": true,\\n    \\\"createStartMenuShortcut\\\": true\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Passo 4: Gerar Arquivo .exe\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build final\\nelectron-builder --win --publish never\\n\\n# Resultado: dist/Áquila Pro Setup 1.0.0.exe\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Deployment em Servidor\\n\\n### Opção 1: Servidor Local (Recomendado para Escolas)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Instalar Node.js no servidor\\nhttps://nodejs.org/en/download/\\n\\n# 2. Clonar repositório\\ngit clone https://github.com/seu-usuario/aquila-pro.git\\ncd aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 4. Configurar variáveis de ambiente\\ncp .env.example .env\\n# Editar .env com dados da escola\\n\\n# 5. Iniciar servidor\\nnpm start\\n\\n# 6. Acessar em http://localhost:3000\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 2: Cloud (AWS, Azure, Google Cloud)\\n\\n```bash\\n# Exemplo com AWS EC2\\n\\n# 1. Criar instância EC2 (Ubuntu 20.04)\\n# 2. SSH para instância\\nssh -i chave.pem ubuntu@seu-ip\\n\\n# 3. Instalar dependências\\nsudo apt update\\nsudo apt install nodejs npm postgresql\\n\\n# 4. Clonar e configurar\\ngit clone seu-repositorio\\ncd aquila-pro\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 5. Configurar PM2 para manter serviço rodando\\nnpm install -g pm2\\npm2 start npm --name \\\"aquila-pro\\\" -- start\\npm2 startup\\npm2 save\\n\\n# 6. Configurar Nginx como proxy\\nsudo apt install nginx\\n# Configurar /etc/nginx/sites-available/default\\n```\\n\\n### Opção 3: Docker (Para Escalabilidade)\\n\\n```dockerfile\\n# Dockerfile\\nFROM node:18-alpine\\n\\nWORKDIR /app\\n\\nCOPY package*.json ./\\nRUN npm install\\n\\nCOPY . .\\n\\nRUN npm run build\\n\\nEXPOSE 3000\\n\\nCMD [\\\"npm\\\", \\\"start\\\"]\\n```\\n\\n```bash\\n# Build e executar\\ndocker build -t aquila-pro .\\ndocker run -p 3000:3000 -e DATABASE_URL=postgresql://... aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📋 Checklist de Deployment\\n\\n### Antes do Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Testar aplicação localmente\\n- [ ] Executar testes automatizados\\n- [ ] Validar segurança (OWASP Top 10)\\n- [ ] Configurar HTTPS/SSL\\n- [ ] Preparar banco de dados\\n- [ ] Fazer backup de dados\\n- [ ] Documentar processo\\n\\n### Durante o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Parar serviço anterior (se houver)\\n- [ ] Fazer backup do banco de dados\\n- [ ] Executar migrações\\n- [ ] Iniciar novo serviço\\n- [ ] Testar funcionalidades críticas\\n- [ ] Monitorar logs\\n- [ ] Validar performance\\n\\n### Após o Deployment\\n\\n- [ ] Notificar usuários\\n- [ ] Monitorar sistema por 24h\\n- [ ] Coletar feedback\\n- [ ] Documentar issues\\n- [ ] Preparar rollback se necessário\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔒 Segurança no Deployment\\n\\n### HTTPS/SSL\\n\\n```bash\\n# Usar Let's Encrypt (gratuito)\\nsudo apt install certbot python3-certbot-nginx\\nsudo certbot certonly --nginx -d seu-dominio.com\\n\\n# Configurar Nginx\\nserver {\\n    listen 443 ssl http2;\\n    server_name seu-dominio.com;\\n    \\n    ssl_certificate /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/fullchain.pem;\\n    ssl_certificate_key /etc/letsencrypt/live/seu-dominio.com/privkey.pem;\\n    \\n    location / {\\n        proxy_pass http://localhost:3000;\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Firewall\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar UFW (Ubuntu)\\nsudo ufw enable\\nsudo ufw allow 22/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 80/tcp\\nsudo ufw allow 443/tcp\\nsudo ufw deny 3000/tcp  # Bloquear acesso direto\\n```\\n\\n### Variáveis de Ambiente\\n\\n```bash\\n# .env (nunca commitar)\\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@localhost/aquila\\nJWT_SECRET=seu-secret-aleatorio-muito-longo\\nNODE_ENV=production\\nAPI_KEY=sua-chave-api\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Monitoramento\\n\\n### Logs\\n\\n```bash\\n# Ver logs em tempo real\\npm2 logs aquila-pro\\n\\n# Salvar logs\\npm2 save\\npm2 logs aquila-pro > /var/log/aquila-pro.log\\n```\\n\\n### Métricas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Instalar PM2 Plus (monitoramento)\\npm2 install pm2-auto-pull\\npm2 install pm2-logrotate\\n\\n# Dashboard\\npm2 monit\\n```\\n\\n### Alertas\\n\\n```bash\\n# Configurar alertas de CPU/RAM\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull instances 4\\npm2 set pm2-auto-pull max_memory_restart 1G\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔄 Atualização e Rollback\\n\\n### Atualizar Aplicação\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Fazer backup\\npm2 backup\\n\\n# 2. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 3. Atualizar código\\ngit pull origin main\\nnpm install\\nnpm run build\\n\\n# 4. Executar migrações (se houver)\\nnpm run migrate\\n\\n# 5. Reiniciar serviço\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n\\n# 6. Validar\\ncurl http://localhost:3000/health\\n```\\n\\n### Rollback (Se Algo Deu Errado)\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Parar serviço\\npm2 stop aquila-pro\\n\\n# 2. Voltar para versão anterior\\ngit revert HEAD\\nnpm install\\n\\n# 3. Restaurar banco de dados\\npsql -U user -d aquila < backup.sql\\n\\n# 4. Reiniciar\\npm2 start aquila-pro\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📈 Performance\\n\\n### Otimizações\\n\\n```bash\\n# 1. Compressão Gzip\\nserver {\\n    gzip on;\\n    gzip_types text/plain text/css application/json application/javascript;\\n    gzip_min_length 1000;\\n}\\n\\n# 2. Cache\\nproxy_cache_path /var/cache/nginx levels=1:2 keys_zone=my_cache:10m;\\nproxy_cache my_cache;\\nproxy_cache_valid 200 10m;\\n\\n# 3. Load Balancing\\nupstream aquila_backend {\\n    server localhost:3000;\\n    server localhost:3001;\\n    server localhost:3002;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### Benchmarks\\n\\n```bash\\n# Testar performance\\nab -n 1000 -c 100 http://seu-dominio.com/\\n\\n# Esperado:\\n# - Requests/sec: 500+\\n# - Latência média: <100ms\\n# - Taxa de sucesso: 99.9%+\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte Técnico\\n\\n**Contatos:**\\n- Email: deploy@aquilapro.com.br\\n- Slack: #deployment\\n- Documentação: https://docs.aquilapro.com.br\\n\\n**Horário de Suporte:**\\n- Seg-Sex: 08:00-18:00\\n- Sábado: 09:00-13:00\\n- Emergências: 24/7\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Última atualização:** 15 de janeiro de 2024\\n","lines":[1,2],"size":6262,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock","last_embed":{"hash":"1v704ke","at":1774580789052}},
